{
  "_readme": "rules are evaluated top to bottom; first match wins. 'if' keys are profile properties: preferred_holiday_type must equal; budget_min/budget_max bound the profile's 'budget'. 'recommend' is an ordered preference list of product ids: the first one in stock is chosen. No rule match, or nothing in stock, falls back to 'default'.",
